oper positions are already shrinking, productivity gains get normalized rather than rewarded, and the 'AI orchestrator' role may not be fulfilling or even stable. Drawing parallels to historical industrialization (shoemaking, travel agents, newspapers), the author argues this is not a simple tool swap but a structural transformation of software development. The democratization narrative is questioned \u2014 easier creation floods markets without guaranteeing discovery or economic benefit for individual developers. The pace of change may not allow adequate time for retraining, and even senior engineers face uncertainty about their long-term role as AI-written codebases become increasingly opaque.","image":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/2dTENijF30c/sddefault.jpg","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-04-27T19:30:01.000Z"},{"id":"qBzcytHdY","title":"Exploring a New Approach to Realistic Lighting: Radiance Cascades","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3so7xdZHKxw","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/exploring-a-new-approach-to-realistic-lighting-radiance-cascades-qbzcythdy","summary":null,"image":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/3so7xdZHKxw/sddefault.jpg","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2024-07-02T11:00:03.000Z"},{"id":"qdZmuIpcK","title":"How Quake Failed their way to Success","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CMFjgWQCGC8","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/how-quake-failed-their-way-to-success-qdzmuipck","summary":null,"image":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/CMFjgWQCGC8/sddefault.jpg","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2024-04-11T11:00:09.000Z"},{"id":"0sNbQuGFW","title":"When Optimisations Work, But for the Wrong Reasons","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hf27qsQPRLQ","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/when-optimisations-work-but-for-the-wrong-reasons-0snbqugfw","summary":null,"image":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/hf27qsQPRLQ/sddefault.jpg","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2024-01-29T15